        22,
        22
      ],
      "anchor": "A p.22 eq (2.58)",
      "quote": "Note that with respect to Tgauged(z), the currents"
    },
    {
      "text": "A",
      "section": "§2.2，(2.53)",
      "pages": [
        21,
        21
      ],
      "anchor": "A p.21 eq (2.53)",
      "quote": "BRST charge which generates the above transformations is therefore given by"
    },
    {
      "text": "A",
      "section": "§2.2",
      "pages": [
        14,
        14
      ],
      "anchor": "A p.14 §2.2",
      "quote": "the holomorphic BRST-cohomology (or chiral algebra) of a B-gauged WZW model on SL(2)"
    },
    {
      "text": "A",
      "section": "§3.3，(3.54)",
      "pages": [
        64,
        64
      ],
      "anchor": "A p.64 eq (3.54)",
      "quote": "the central charge of Ttotal(z) will be given by"
